WEBVTT

00:02:59.788 --> 00:03:01.204
prolonging our carbon habit

00:03:01.204 --> 00:03:04.079
like a drug running through
the economy’s veins.

00:03:04.704 --> 00:03:06.663
You don't have to be an economist like me

00:03:06.704 --> 00:03:08.871
to know that these numbers
just don't add up.

00:03:09.371 --> 00:03:13.788
That our economic paradigm
is neither sustainable nor equitable.

00:03:14.913 --> 00:03:16.121
Climate change,

00:03:16.121 --> 00:03:17.621
rupturing inequalities,

00:03:17.663 --> 00:03:20.038
record numbers of people
forced from their homes

00:03:20.079 --> 00:03:22.538
by conflict and crisis.

00:03:22.579 --> 00:03:24.788
For all of our power,

00:03:24.829 --> 00:03:27.413
these are the weapons we have built.

00:03:27.413 --> 00:03:29.163
Less tangible than a gun,

00:03:29.163 --> 00:03:32.829
but just as real, just as deadly.